# upstream source this image is built from (llama.cpp, not this repo's git history)
#
# LFM3 / LFM3-VL support is ggml-org/llama.cpp PR #31252
# (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/31252), squash-merged into master as:
19cce6919992fdffd92e0ac152caaf1e2b8f254e
#
# Why a custom build at all: as of 2026-10-28 the newest PUBLISHED llama.cpp release is
# b11936, and `src/models/lfm3.cpp` returns 404 at both b11935 and b11936 - the daily
# release images therefore cannot load an LFM3 GGUF yet ("unknown model arch 'lfm3'").
# The merge landed at 2026-10-27T16:06Z, i.e. after the b11935 tag was cut.
#
# To move to an official release once one ships the arch (check:
#   curl -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\n' \
#     https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/b11937/src/models/lfm3.cpp
# expecting 200), set REF to that tag; keep CPU_VARIANT=avx2 to serve the model on CPU only.
UPSTREAM=https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp.git
REF=19cce6919992fdffd92e0ac152caaf1e2b8f254e
CPU_VARIANT=avx2
